      "comment": "SPRING ESPRESSO (5) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at Warragul in a handy 26.07 beating Galloping Red. Got the money at her only try from this box. The one to beat again. DR. FALLON (7) turned in a moderate performance last time when sixth at Traralgon over 425m behind Aston Giovanni (24.71) in a R/A FIN. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Bold showing expected. PAW VINE (8) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 435m behind Springer's Boy (24.76) in a Grade 5. Worth following up. PAW DANGER (3) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fifth (23.16), beaten 6 lengths. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts.",
